From 18d5a384851f31f06e28dc6d4ff5227442783b10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <myemail@example.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:54:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Playwright: send Chrome's brand list for a custom Chrome user
 agent

With a userAgent override, calculateUserAgentMetadata() sends no brands,
so Chromium keeps the binary's own list (bundled Chromium: only
"Chromium" at its real version) whatever the UA claims. Build the list
Chrome <major> sends (GenerateBrandVersionList in user_agent_utils.cc).
Covers pages and service workers. REBROWSER_PATCHES_UA_BRANDS_FIX=0
turns it off.

Patches regenerated with release/port.mjs playwright-core 1.64.1 --regen
--write. New test suite: uabrands.
